uality.","Mean versus median: the mean is above the median in 5 of 6 years, because a few highly cited works pull the average up. The widest gap is 2020: mean 11, median 3, top work 69. The median is the better guide to a typical work.","Recent years: works from 2024 have had less than three years to be cited, so their values will rise.","Small base: the values for 2018–2024 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care.","Few works: 2017 and 2026 have fewer than 10 works (2017: 5, 2026: 4), too few for a band. Each of those works is drawn as a dot."]}}}